flowchart LR
    ClientA[Client A<br/>QUIC stream 1]
    ClientB[Client B<br/>QUIC datagram]
    
    GW[HTTP/3 Gateway<br/>QUIC listener UDP 4433]
    
    subgraph Gateway Internal
      Router[Frame Router<br/>msg_frame_decode]
      Routes[Actor Route Table<br/>actor_id -> stream/datagram]
    end
    
    ActorX[Actor X<br/>reliable stream]
    ActorY[Actor Y<br/>datagram]
    
    ClientA -->|QUIC stream| GW
    ClientB -->|QUIC datagram| GW
    GW --> Router
    Router --> Routes
    Routes -->|actor_id match| ActorX
    Routes -->|actor_id match| ActorY
    
    style GW fill:#bbf,stroke:#333
    style Router fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style Routes fill:#ffb,stroke:#333
    style ActorX fill:#bfb,stroke:#333
    style ActorY fill:#bfb,stroke:#333